B.bfv=s(["Sa\u011f\u0131m \xf6ncesi \xf6n dald\u0131rma + ka\u011f\u0131t havlu ile tek tek kurulama; sa\u011f\u0131m sonras\u0131 son dald\u0131rma.","Sa\u011f\u0131m makinesi vakum/pulsat\xf6r kontrol\xfc 6 ayda bir; meme lastikleri zaman\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015fsin.","Yatakl\u0131k kuru ve temiz; serbest durak ve gezinti alan\u0131 g\xfcnde en az 2 kez kaz\u0131ns\u0131n.","Kuruya \xe7\u0131karmada kuru d\xf6nem tedavisi + meme ba\u015f\u0131 t\u0131kac\u0131; klinik vakalara k\xfclt\xfcr-antibiyogram.","Kronik (3+ atak) ve k\xf6r memeli inekler i\xe7in ay\u0131klama plan\u0131; SHS (somatik h\xfccre) ayl\u0131k takip."],t.s)
