B.bdh=s(["Y\u0131lda 2 kez rutin t\u0131rnak kesimi; topal inek 48 saat i\xe7inde bak\u0131ls\u0131n.","Ayak banyosu (formalin/bak\u0131r s\xfclfat) haftada 2\u20133 kez, \xe7\xf6zelti 150\u2013200 ge\xe7i\u015fte yenilensin.","Zeminde kayma, \xe7ukur ve g\xfcbre birikimi giderilsin; bekleme alan\u0131nda s\xfcre k\u0131salt\u0131ls\u0131n.","Asidozu \xf6nleyen rasyon (yeterli kaba yem/efektif lif), biotin-\xe7inko takviyesi.","Ayl\u0131k topall\u0131k skorlamas\u0131 yap\u0131l\u0131p kayda ge\xe7sin."],t.s)
